  "scope": "Preserve selected modern DXF DICTIONARYVAR records under a reachable ordinary application child dictionary, requiring one actual containing entry and matching typed/current-raw bodies. Freeze them before callbacks, transcode the modeled value for output encoding, and verify actual emitted fields/references. Independently read selected full-file peer outputs; this does not certify arbitrary documents, native setvar/getvar semantics or a DWG custom-owner profile.",
